# Files that run on Linux (Cloud Build, Cloud Run, Cloud Shell, CI) must keep LF line endings
# on every machine, including Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true. A shebang or
# `set -euo pipefail` ending in \r fails on Linux. `pnpm check:eol` enforces this.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
docker/** text eol=lf
deploy/** text eol=lf
